  "editable": true,
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Qué es esta prueba",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Comando:** `./scripts/caos/fallo3-saturacion-bd.sh`  \n**Caso del documento:** Punto 11 · Fallo 3 (Base de datos / saturación temporal de Aurora Serverless v2 y auto-escalado).\n\n**Qué deberías ver:** *Simulación local de Aurora Serverless v2.* La **capacidad** sube en escalones 0,5 → 1 → 2 → 4 ACU mientras la **CPU usada** se pega a la asignada (línea punteada), con una marca naranja por escalado, y baja sola a 0,5 al terminar; el **p95 del check-out** sube durante la saturación y se recupera; **Reinicios** en 0.\n\n**Criterio de éxito:** la capacidad sube mientras hay saturación y vuelve sola a 0,5 ACU; 0 reinicios de PostgreSQL; integridad OK.\n\nAntes de empezar: `./scripts/reiniciar-entorno.sh`. No interrumpas el script en las esperas."
      },
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Capacidad de la base (ACU)",
      "description": "Nivel que asignó el escalador: 0,5 (normal) → 1 → 2 → 4. 1 ACU local ≈ 1 núcleo y ~1 GiB.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max(jobbi_bd_capacidad_acu)",
          "legendFormat": "ACU",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 2
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 4
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 1,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Reinicios de PostgreSQL",
      "description": "Debe quedarse igual: el escalado es en caliente.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total{namespace=\"aws-local\", container=\"postgres\"}) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "reinicios",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "id": 3,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "PostgreSQL · CPU usada vs. asignada (núcleos)",
      "description": "La línea punteada es la capacidad: sube en escalones cuando la CPU usada se pega al límite y baja cuando pasa la saturación. Mientras la usada toca el límite, la base está frenada (ver throttling).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{namespace=\"aws-local\", container=\"postgres\"}[20s]))",
          "legendFormat": "CPU usada",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max(kube_pod_container_resource_limits{namespace=\"aws-local\", container=\"postgres\", resource=\"cpu\"})",
          "legendFormat": "CPU asignada (límite)",
          "refId": "B",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max(kube_pod_container_resource_requests{namespace=\"aws-local\", container=\"postgres\", resource=\"cpu\"})",
          "legendFormat": "CPU reservada (request)",
          "refId": "C",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "CPU asignada (límite)"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.lineInterpolation",
                "value": "stepAfter"
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.lineStyle",
                "value": {
                  "fill": "dash",
                  "dash": [
                    10,
                    6
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.lineWidth",
                "value": 2
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.fillOpacity",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "CPU reservada (request)"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.lineInterpolation",
                "value": "stepAfter"
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.lineStyle",
                "value": {
                  "fill": "dash",
                  "dash": [
                    10,
                    6
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.lineWidth",
                "value": 2
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.fillOpacity",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "orange"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "id": 4,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Impacto en el usuario · p95 del check-out (lee y escribe en la base)",
      "description": "Puede subir mientras la base está frenada y vuelve a bajar cuando el escalador le da capacidad.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(jobbi_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{service=\"gateway\", route=\"/api/bff/contrataciones/{contratacion_id}/check-out\"}[20s]))) * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "p95 check-out",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(jobbi_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{service=\"gateway\"}[20s]))) * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "p95 gateway",
          "refId": "B",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 400
              }
